    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Sandra Beattie",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110336136209676359694/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIOcfwbqEbDMAywp4FW3r3w_4WM1VVq3KH3vf_xi9FmuEcUMg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Love the products but the packaging is unacceptable. The decorative gold on the dropper of all three products is peeling off. The gold flakes off stick to my hands & often get on my face. Vivier gave me a complimentary bottle when I brought this to their attention the first time. The second time they sent me a new dropper saying they were working on improving the design. These products are too expensive to have to put up with this inconvenience.",
        "time": 1714483466,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Catherine M",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108084357693082255135/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLcPBlWZuiI_VI_rN-J_QyjKhSgD9LkmDiwKvfIJmveKH1DVw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Firstly I have to say I love the products, however I received the eye cream as a gift and it was completely dried out. I contacted Vivier customer service and they were unwilling to help. There resolution was that I go back to the person that gave it to me and have them send it back. Which I believe is tacky.\nIt's obvious that it's a Vivier product and the company should stand behind it and replace it.",
        "time": 1704812950,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Julie Ann",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116307140536847296631/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUNex5WuZFPpmIBLuNqInerIlB1SjYFWHgCpPmdgUHulWtTtwI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "This review is based on a lack of communication relating to a new policy that Vivier purposefully decided not to broadcast with their dedicated clientele.\nBe advised that when placing an order with Vivier, you will no longer receive your package - without exception, you will have to go pick it up at a post office.\nI am not certain if this is a cost-saving measure / decision on Vivier's part, or a new policy with Canada Post.\nWhy they did not mention on their site is negligent, as some of us are not easily mobile. Furthermore, in this case I had placed an order by phone with someone who would have been very aware of this new policy, yet she decided not to mention it.\nI did not even get a delivery notice to know where the merchandise was left! To my utter surprise, I received an email saying my order was delivered. I thought it was delivered to a wrong address at best, or stolen at worst.\nI called Vivier to track down my package, and that was the first I heard of this new policy that clients will no longer be receiving their packages. I was told so matter-of-factly. The customer service agent stated it as if it was no big deal. I took the opportunity to ask if they intend on using an alternative courier service that will offer delivery to their dedicated clients, and it was a quick, clear and resounding NO.\nI think their existing and potential new clients should be aware that if you are not easily mobile, or take public transit to commute, if you order from Vivier Pharma, you will be forced to take a trip.\nShame on them for being this dismissive, uncaring and silent on the matter.",
        "time": 1673974837,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "t",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101527556312528136582/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJGjakmvGA7HdOR0Nyagtxr2TUSSswDf5EDzR9PtjeIzMyOGA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 years ago",
        "text": "Great company, wonderful products. I've been dealing with Vivier for just over three years, their reps are wonderful to work with and have been extremely helpful and supportive in growing our businesses together. All my clients love the products and we look forward to see what more they bring to the industry!",
        "time": 1513571930,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sandra Swiet",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101954596282289019976/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKIzDwKH0P3jvQKGxQJR-U_TVYQRLVnSlBUHADLXNg1F0mysw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "UNSAFE! BEWARE!\nI asked this company if the Vivier CE peptide serum is safe during breastfeeding. They gave me a canned reply via social media. I asked again yes or no is this safe? They saw my question and ignored it. Clearly they have something to hide if they can’t simply say yes! They suggested I go to my doctors to ask? All other companies I have asked state either yes it is safe or no it is not. The fact they refuse to answer makes me very suspicious and no longer trust this company!",
        "time": 1670777019,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
